<Information title="About" description="Set up an Elixir and Phoenix development environment on Linux and macOS with phx.tools.">
<p>phx.tools is a shell script from Optimum Tech that configures your Elixir and Phoenix development environment on Linux and macOS. Once you finish running the script, you can create a new Phoenix application and launch the server.</p>
<p>The <a href="/">homepage</a> includes the installation command and recordings of the setup process. You can <a href="https://github.com/optimumBA/phx.tools/blob/main/static/script.sh">read the source code</a> before running it.</p>
</Information>
